            },
            "description": {
              "value": "Using your weapon as a lever, you force your opponent to end up right where you want them. Make a Strike with a onehanded melee weapon. If the Strike hits, you can Reposition the target up to 10 feet. You can move the target through your space during this movement. Your Strike gains the following failure effect.\n\n- **Failure:** You can force the creature to move as you would on a success, but you can move the target only 5 feet."
            }
